      "answer": "Optimise pr_auc; also report roc_auc, precision_at_top_1pct, recall_at_top_1pct."
    },
    {
      "match": "model preference",
      "answer": "A single baseline model is fine (single_baseline)."
    },
    {
      "match": "deployment",
